# The "dx bass" preset: a line with accents; the modulators' envelopes give each note its attack, velocity its bark.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 1.0
track bass
preset 44 128 0 0 255 50 0 0 128 0 128 210 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 A1 2 100
note 2 A1 1 60
note 4 C2 2 127
note 6 A1 1 70
note 8 E2 2 100
note 10 G1 2 127
note 12 A1 3 50
expect sound 0 16
expect idle 22
expect peak_below -6      # one voice peaks at -12 dBFS; a releasing note overlaps the next
